OL,3,GNEWSATeenage cyclist dies after
OL,4,Ahit-and-run collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his late teens has died after
OL,7,Fa hit-and-run collision in County Meath
OL,8,Fin the Republic of Ireland.
OL,10,FGardai (Irish police) said the incident
OL,11,Finvolving a van and a bicycle occurred
OL,12,Fat about 20:05 local time on Tuesday at
OL,13,FNugentstown, Kells.
OL,15,FThey said the van failed to remain at
OL,16,Fthe scene, where the cyclist was
OL,17,Fpronounced dead.
OL,19,FThe coroner has been notified and the
OL,20,Froad remains closed.
